---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Pavan Kumar">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>AI Data Engineer transitioning from Deloitte to Infocepts — building the future of agentic data platforms</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-content">
          <h2>Hi, I'm Pavan</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            I'm an AI Data Engineer passionate about building agentic solutions that transform how enterprises work with data. 
            My journey has taken me from financial analysis at Deloitte to architecting end-to-end AI platforms at Infocepts.
          </p>
          <p>
            I specialize in <strong>multi-agent systems</strong>, <strong>lakehouse architectures</strong>, and <strong>local LLM deployments</strong> — 
            building production systems that combine the reasoning power of LLMs with the reliability of traditional data engineering.
          </p>
          <p>
            My flagship project, <strong>LakeMind</strong>, demonstrates a complete local data platform: medallion architecture with PySpark, 
            DuckDB analytics, Airflow orchestration, a semantic layer for governed natural-language queries, and ChromaDB RAG 
            with Ollama — all running locally with zero cloud costs.
          </p>
          
          <div class="timeline">
            <h3>Career Journey</h3>
            <div class="timeline-items">
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <span class="timeline-date">2024 — Present</span>
                  <h4>AI Data Engineer — Infocepts</h4>
                  <p>Building agentic AI platforms for enterprise clients. Lakehouse architecture, multi-agent systems, local LLM deployments.</p>
                  <div class="timeline-tech">PySpark • DuckDB • Airflow • Ollama • ChromaDB • FastAPI • Streamlit</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <span class="timeline-date">2022 — 2024</span>
                  <h4>Data Engineer — Deloitte Consulting</h4>
                  <p>Financial data pipelines, regulatory reporting, and analytics platforms for Fortune 500 clients. Migrated legacy systems to cloud-native architectures.</p>
                  <div class="timeline-tech">SQL • PySpark • AWS • Snowflake • dbt • Airflow • Tableau</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <span class="timeline-date">2020 — 2022</span>
                  <h4>Data Analyst — Financial Services</h4>
                  <p>Automated reporting, predictive modeling, and dashboard development. Built foundations in statistical analysis and data storytelling.</p>
                  <div class="timeline-tech">Python • Pandas • SQL • Power BI • Statistical Modeling</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-sidebar">
          <div class="card skills-card">
            <h3>Technical Skills</h3>
            <div class="skill-category">
              <h4>Agentic AI & LLMs</h4>
              <div class="skill-tags">
                <span>LangChain</span><span>LangGraph</span><span>Ollama</span><span>Phi-3/Llama</span>
                <span>RAG</span><span>ChromaDB</span><span>FAISS</span><span>Function Calling</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-category">
              <h4>Data Engineering</h4>
              <div class="skill-tags">
                <span>PySpark</span><span>Delta Lake</span><span>DuckDB</span><span>Airflow</span>
                <span>Medallion Arch</span><span>Star Schema</span><span>dbt</span><span>Parquet</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-category">
              <h4>Cloud & DevOps</h4>
              <div class="skill-tags">
                <span>AWS</span><span>Lambda</span><span>Bedrock</span><span>S3</span>
                <span>DynamoDB</span><span>Docker</span><span>GitHub Actions</span><span>Serverless</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-category">
              <h4>GenAI Applications</h4>
              <div class="skill-tags">
                <span>Gemini</span><span>Claude</span><span>Bedrock</span><span>Document AI</span>
                <span>Chatbots</span><span>Streaming</span><span>Extraction</span><span>Validation</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card highlight-card mt-4">
            <h3>Currently Exploring</h3>
            <ul class="exploring-list">
              <li>Multi-agent orchestration with LangGraph</li>
              <li>Local LLM fine-tuning (QLoRA, LoRA)</li>
              <li>Agentic RAG with self-correction</li>
              <li>Semantic layers for governed AI queries</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-card card highlight-card">
        <h2>Let's Build Together</h2>
        <p>Open to collaborating on agentic AI, lakehouse platforms, or GenAI applications. Currently at Infocepts — always interested in connecting with fellow builders.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary mt-2">Get In Touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 8rem 0 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--foreground), var(--muted));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .page-hero p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 968px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-content p {
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-content strong {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .timeline {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .timeline h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
  }

  .timeline-items {
    position: relative;
  }

  .timeline-items::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 12px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .timeline-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .timeline-marker {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
    border: 3px solid var(--background);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .timeline-content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .timeline-date {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .timeline-content h4 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-content p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .timeline-tech {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: monospace;
  }

  .skills-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .skill-category {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .skill-category h4 {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .skill-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .skill-tags span {
    padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem;
    background: var(--background);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .skill-tags span:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .exploring-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .exploring-list li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .exploring-list li::before {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .mt-4 {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-section {
    padding: 4rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .cta-card {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cta-card h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-card p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>